  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">High value opportunity - China Offshore Wind Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Chinese government has approved 44 offshore wind power projects in Aug 2014. The project aims to help China&apos;s transformation to sustainable energy, by demonstrating Danish technologies in the offshore sector. 

There has been sound cooperation between China and Denmark in renewable energy development both in the government and commercial level. Chinese government is willing to continue the corporation with Danish business community in offshore wind area. Chinese offshore wind market could be another focus area to contribute Chinese renewable development and sustainable growth of the society</narrative>
  </description>
